<ServiceHero
  section="services"
  slug="washer-repair/samsung-not-spinning"
  eyebrow="Samsung Washer Not Spinning · Diagnostic Guide · Same Day Southern California"
  title="Samsung Washer Not Spinning? Read the Code First"
  subtitle="A Samsung that won't spin is usually an unbalanced load (UR/UB), a drain it must clear first (5C/SC), or the door lock (dC) — and Samsung tells you which. Here's what each means and what's safe to check."
  heroImageTitle="Samsung Washer Not Spinning Diagnosis and Repair"
